WEBVTT

00:26.440 --> 00:26.960
Go

00:27.440 --> 00:29.280
bring me Lingtian's head.

00:31.840 --> 00:32.360
Yes.

00:36.320 --> 00:37.040
Go

00:37.200 --> 00:38.960
bring me this person's head.

00:41.440 --> 00:41.920
Go

00:42.280 --> 00:43.760
bring me his head.

00:44.800 --> 00:45.240
I

00:45.360 --> 00:46.160
better hurry.

00:47.720 --> 00:48.320
Yes.

00:50.200 --> 00:52.160
I want to become the strongest sword cultivator.

00:52.160 --> 00:54.600
I want to marry the most beautiful senior sister.

00:54.600 --> 00:57.120
I want to taste all spiritual herbs and immortal fruits.

00:57.120 --> 00:57.840
I

00:58.040 --> 00:59.040
want to make money

00:59.080 --> 01:00.210
to repay my parents.

01:00.360 --> 01:00.800
Good,

01:01.200 --> 01:02.120
you're the one.

01:02.960 --> 01:03.480
Go

01:04.120 --> 01:05.920
kill the person in the painting.

01:06.440 --> 01:07.400
Me.

01:18.600 --> 01:19.160
Brother.

03:14.720 --> 03:16.360
Kill this person

03:16.680 --> 03:19.079
and Yao Yifei can be revived.

03:26.240 --> 03:28.000
Your sword technique looks familiar.

03:28.000 --> 03:28.960
Who taught you?

04:26.520 --> 04:29.320
Although the heavenly law has distorted my perception,

04:29.320 --> 04:30.440
I can be certain

04:31.320 --> 04:31.920
that you

04:32.640 --> 04:33.560
are me.

04:36.000 --> 04:37.720
You fell in love with Yao Yifei,

04:37.720 --> 04:38.600
and to save her,

04:38.880 --> 04:41.080
you became a puppet of the heavenly law.

04:41.760 --> 04:42.840
Who are you really?

04:52.200 --> 04:53.400
How is this possible!

04:54.120 --> 04:56.120
I am you from 300 years in the future.

04:57.080 --> 04:58.640
It brought you from the past

04:59.120 --> 05:01.200
to make us kill each other.

05:01.800 --> 05:02.680
Why?

05:03.560 --> 05:06.360
Because my existence threatens the heavenly law.

05:06.600 --> 05:07.760
Only my past self

05:08.160 --> 05:09.840
can kill my future self.

05:10.040 --> 05:10.560
No,

05:10.840 --> 05:11.840
I won't kill you,

05:13.200 --> 05:14.240
nor can I.

05:14.640 --> 05:15.600
But I will.

05:16.760 --> 05:19.280
If past and future meet in the present,

05:19.920 --> 05:21.600
only one of us can remain.

05:22.440 --> 05:23.680
You are my past self.

05:24.000 --> 05:25.080
If you die,

05:25.400 --> 05:27.000
I will cease to exist as well.

05:27.760 --> 05:28.520
So,

05:28.800 --> 05:30.060
I must be the one to die.

05:31.000 --> 05:31.480
Wait.

05:31.480 --> 05:32.610
Time is running out.

05:33.200 --> 05:35.260
I'll help you return to 300 years ago.

05:35.760 --> 05:38.090
I hope you can find a way to break this cycle

05:38.720 --> 05:40.780
and end this endless reincarnation.

05:42.920 --> 05:44.240
Give up,

05:44.360 --> 05:45.320
Lingtian.

05:46.120 --> 05:48.000
This is your fate,

05:48.360 --> 05:49.720
you can't escape it.

05:52.480 --> 05:53.880
Who says I want to escape?

05:57.000 --> 06:00.000
If the heavenly law toys with all beings through fate,

06:00.320 --> 06:01.580
then this heavenly law

06:01.880 --> 06:03.280
is better off destroyed.

06:27.280 --> 06:28.360
What rotten luck.

06:29.960 --> 06:32.000
The Sword Heir's investiture ceremony,

06:32.000 --> 06:34.130
yet we're stuck doing this dirty work.

06:35.080 --> 06:35.520
He...

06:35.840 --> 06:36.840
he's not dead.

06:38.720 --> 06:40.800
Elder Qin He shattered his dantian,

06:41.120 --> 06:43.480
Senior Brother Qin Chuan dug out his sword bone,

06:43.480 --> 06:45.120
yet he's still alive,

06:45.840 --> 06:47.640
truly a heaven-blessed genius.

06:48.480 --> 06:49.159
Why don't we

06:49.320 --> 06:51.450
drain his last bit of spiritual power?

06:51.680 --> 06:54.010
It'll make our final sendoff worthwhile.

07:03.080 --> 07:03.800
What?

07:07.640 --> 07:08.840
How is this possible!

07:13.640 --> 07:14.570
What's going on?

07:15.600 --> 07:18.260
I clearly perished along with the Heavenly Way.

07:18.440 --> 07:19.770
Investiture Ceremony.

07:20.360 --> 07:22.490
I've returned to 300 years in the past.

07:22.880 --> 07:23.940
If that's the case,

07:24.400 --> 07:27.600
I won't let the tragedy of my previous life repeat itself.

07:36.640 --> 07:37.920
The eighth toll!

07:38.360 --> 07:39.680
After so many years,

07:39.920 --> 07:42.159
our Sword God Sect has produced another

07:42.240 --> 07:43.640
peerless genius.

07:44.280 --> 07:45.240
It seems

07:45.560 --> 07:47.820
he's qualified to become the Sword Heir.

07:57.040 --> 07:58.040
Nine tolls!

07:58.600 --> 08:00.600
Unheard of in a century.

08:01.920 --> 08:02.920
For two years,

08:03.400 --> 08:05.160
I've spared no resources

08:05.400 --> 08:07.280
cultivating Lingtian's sword bone,

08:07.280 --> 08:10.040
and now it has secured my son Chuan the position of Sword Heir.

08:10.040 --> 08:10.760
Worth it.

08:20.520 --> 08:22.050
Why is it tolling by itself?

08:22.360 --> 08:23.040
Could it be

08:23.760 --> 08:25.200
that fellow's sword bone

08:25.720 --> 08:27.400
is truly extraordinary?

08:32.919 --> 08:34.159
Ten tolls!

08:34.480 --> 08:35.610
This is impossible,

08:35.640 --> 08:36.360
an auditory hallucination,

08:36.360 --> 08:37.890
it must be a hallucination.

08:39.520 --> 08:41.720
Ringing the Chaos Bell from a distance.

08:41.840 --> 08:42.840
Could it be

08:43.159 --> 08:46.690
Qin Chuan has comprehended the Chaos Pattern on the Chaos Bell?

08:46.960 --> 08:47.840
Qin Chuan,

08:48.080 --> 08:49.560
a heaven-sent talent.

08:50.080 --> 08:52.520
First winning the Sword Heir Competition,

08:52.720 --> 08:55.000
then ringing the Chaos Bell ten times.

08:55.320 --> 08:57.400
According to the Sword God Sect's ancestral precepts,

08:57.400 --> 08:59.080
I hereby appoint Qin Chuan as...

08:59.080 --> 09:00.280
Eleven tolls!

09:03.880 --> 09:07.080
My son will surely go down in the Sword God Sect's history.

09:13.760 --> 09:14.680
I, Qin Chuan,

09:15.840 --> 09:18.170
will become an unparalleled Sword Saint.

09:50.080 --> 09:50.680
That's...

09:51.120 --> 09:52.000
Lingtian?

09:53.600 --> 09:54.800
Why is Lingtian here?

09:55.400 --> 09:56.280
I heard

09:56.400 --> 09:58.000
his cultivation went wrong,

09:58.080 --> 09:59.610
his dantian was shattered.

10:02.160 --> 10:04.820
Those two useless fools, Zhang Long and Zhao Hu,

10:05.120 --> 10:07.240
couldn't even dispose of a cripple

10:07.240 --> 10:08.500
with a broken dantian.

10:08.840 --> 10:09.480
Lingtian,

10:10.120 --> 10:12.560
you dare disrupt my investiture ceremony,

10:13.920 --> 10:15.400
you're asking for death!

10:18.520 --> 10:19.240
You

10:21.480 --> 10:23.520
are unworthy of becoming the Sword Heir.

10:23.520 --> 10:24.520
Rebellious disciple,

10:24.520 --> 10:26.040
get down here now!

10:28.400 --> 10:29.160
You

10:30.280 --> 10:32.080
are unworthy of being my master.

10:34.880 --> 10:35.800
It's him,

10:36.320 --> 10:38.760
he made the Chaos Bell toll eleven times.

10:45.800 --> 10:47.160
Since you've returned,

10:47.400 --> 10:49.130
I'll avenge the theft of my bone

10:49.320 --> 10:50.760
today.

10:51.360 --> 10:52.820
With a shattered dantian,

10:53.120 --> 10:56.050
how can he possess such terrifying spiritual power?

10:56.240 --> 10:58.770
He has fully comprehended the Chaos Pattern,

10:59.240 --> 11:01.500
as long as he's in the Sacred Bell Square,

11:01.760 --> 11:04.020
he can borrow the power of the Chaos Bell.

11:06.520 --> 11:07.240
Lingtian,

11:07.800 --> 11:09.720
I've reached the Spirit Wheel Realm,

11:09.720 --> 11:10.920
if you want revenge,

11:11.200 --> 11:12.400
try in your next life.

11:15.920 --> 11:16.760
Die!

11:24.240 --> 11:25.560
Fifteen tolls!

11:26.080 --> 11:28.340
Even compared to our founding ancestor,

11:28.400 --> 11:29.800
he's no less impressive.

11:30.080 --> 11:31.760
Trash will always be trash.

11:32.240 --> 11:33.720
Even after refining my sword bone,

11:33.720 --> 11:35.800
you're still so pathetically weak.

11:36.720 --> 11:37.560
Lingtian.

11:38.040 --> 11:40.320
You merely borrowed the power of the Chaos Bell.

11:40.320 --> 11:42.040
If we were outside Sacred Bell Square,

11:42.040 --> 11:42.560
I...

11:43.160 --> 11:43.840
Lingtian.

11:44.400 --> 11:45.880
If you dare touch my son,

11:46.040 --> 11:47.480
I will tear you to pieces.
